@0    = ~Okay, this is going to get embarrassing if I don't say something now.~
@1    = ~D'you prefer women over men? I thought you might be interested in me, but now there's this thing with Sarah, and I wasn't sure...~
@2    = ~I'm not sure where I stand on that, but I know I am interested in you, Faren.~
@3    = ~Whether I like women over men, I know I do like Sarah.~
@4    = ~I'm not sure how I feel about Sarah, but I know I like women.~
@5    = ~Thanks for clearing it up, <CHARNAME>. I'll have a word with you later.~
@6    = ~Thanks for clearing it up, <CHARNAME>. Better to know sooner than later, so I don't make an idiot of myself.~
@7    = ~Ah, it's good to be out and about, isn't it? Things to do, people to see...~
@8    = ~Sarah? Are you cold?~
@9    = ~A bit. It seems silly for a ranger to need it, but I think I should make myself a thicker coat one of these days.~
@10   = ~I'll buy you one next time we see a stall, okay?~
@11   = ~Oh - well, if it's not too much trouble for you.~
@12   = ~No trouble. We don't want you shivering too much and dropping your weapons, now do we?~
@13   = ~You know, I kind of regret not taking off and living in the forest back in the day. It might've been fun.~
@14   = ~I do not consider it "taking off", and if you want a holiday you'd do better going to the beach.~
@15   = ~Oh, gods, no. Have you seen what happens to my hair when it's windy?~
@16   = ~I went to the beach once, when I was little. Trust me, you don't want to know how long it took to take a brush through it.~
@17   = ~I think I remember seeing you around Imnesvale when you came before. I never spoke to you, but your friend Araden was interested in looking around the woods.~
@18   = ~Heh, I remember him wandering off. I remember, it was really sunny, and he wanted to stretch his legs. Did he try to flirt with you?~
@19   = ~He scared away a rabbit I was hunting and I ended up giving him quite a talking-to.~
@20   = ~No wonder he was all sheepish when he came back!~
@21   = ~I'm truly sorry about what happened, Faren.~
@22   = ~I - no, it's okay. It's feels good to remember them like they were when they were alive.~
@23   = ~Then I'm glad I could help you do that.~
